TITLE Equilibration at 100C with calcite+gypsum+aragonite and mixed gas (gas at 25C)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -totals S
END
